.TH LIBKECCAK_K12_DESTROY 3 LIBKECCAK
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <libkeccak/k12.h>

void libkeccak_k12_destroy(struct libkeccak_k12 *\fIctx\fP);
.fi
.PP
Link with
.IR -lkeccak .
.SH NAME
libkeccak_k12_destroy - release a KT128 context
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR libkeccak_k12_destroy ()
function frees the context and every buffer it owns. Passing NULL is
allowed and performs no action.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libkeccak_k12_create (3),
.BR libkeccak_k12 (7)
